---
# The project's checks, with one exception for test code, justified here as
# every disabled check is.
#
# -readability-magic-numbers, -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers
#     A test's data and expected values are literal by nature: they are the
#     hand-computed numbers the test checks against, written next to the
#     working that produced them. Naming each one would move it away from
#     that working and make the test harder to check by hand.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-magic-numbers,
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers
